---
import SketchbookArt from './SketchbookArt.astro';
---
<section id="about" class="section grid12 about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
  <div class="about__text">
    <h2 id="about-h" class="display" data-reveal>About me</h2>
    <p data-reveal style="--d:1">I built <span class="placeholder">[the thing you built: e.g. the booking flow in Ka-dugo]</span>. I wanted it to <span class="placeholder">[what you were aiming for]</span>.</p>
    <p data-reveal style="--d:2">Then <span class="placeholder">[the problem you ran into: the bug, the deadline, the thing that broke in front of the class]</span>.</p>
    <p data-reveal style="--d:3">What I learned: <span class="placeholder">[the lesson, in one honest sentence]</span>. That’s also why I’m heading toward AI engineering: <span class="placeholder">[your reason]</span>.</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="about__art" data-reveal style="--d:2">
    <SketchbookArt />
    <figcaption class="placeholder">[Swap for a page from your real sketchbook]</figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
